{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEADLIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEADLIST</strong> is a psychological survival horror game where the forest watches you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as <strong>Thalarius</strong>, a paranormal investigator drawn into the cursed Black Forest \u2014 a place where reality fractures, voices whisper lies, and fear is a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What begins as an investigation quickly becomes a fight to survive an environment that twists perception, drains sanity, and punishes every mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the forest, manage scarce resources, and uncover the truth before fear and madness consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This game is currently in Early Access. Content and features will continue to be expanded throughout development.</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>CURRENT FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One playable chapter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Core exploration gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Several paranormal encounters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Two endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Approximately 20\u201330 minutes of gameplay<strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>PLANNED FEATURES </strong><br><strong> </strong><br>Full story across <strong>four chapters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Expanded forest areas and environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Improved survival and sanity mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Additional paranormal encounters and hallucinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More endings and player choices</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"BLACK FOREST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/cb38fa205ed9ccff02d0f44f5da2f4e3d69f3b71.jpg"},{"name":"UNDERGROUND","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/f371dc9c4f52ee52f67fba542a4159bc9c52e5d2.jpg"},{"name":"AT THE BEYOND","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/b54ec355aa34740107f9afd7d384aa47526d1c1b.jpg"},{"name":"NO FLASHLIGHT?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/3917bd12d644dc9298a5999f132f8bca0584025c.jpg"},{"name":"Click 10k times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/6d118ed0f9f43884503746b7d9bddf829a6ee646.jpg"},{"name":"Click 100k times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/a7c62e01bf2631e1c3aefe2e45c616cc539ecb41.jpg"},{"name":"Click 1M times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/57f59a33ed8be3d8e0a36aa819af78e0b3777fdf.jpg"},{"name":"Finish all chapters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/9e57b8c87a443fb6af3594670fa6d80e3f8c697d.jpg"},{"name":"Merry christmas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/000140eb6eb11b2e89ff6e16deee8ce3638b6530.jpg"},{"name":"Happy halloween !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039020/c9650204cff059611a3b52fd7ffb298fe48a339d.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039020?t=1773512525","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039020?t=1773512525","capsule_image":